 in Leh."},{"q":"How many days are enough for Ladakh?","a":"4 days are usually enough to cover the top attractions of Ladakh at a relaxed pace."},{"q":"How much does a hotel cost in Ladakh?","a":"Stays in Ladakh start from ₹400 per night, with options across 7 price categories."},{"q":"What are the top places to visit in Ladakh?","a":"The top attractions are Pangong Tso Lake, Khardung La Pass, Thiksey Monastery, Nubra Valley, Shanti Stupa."}],"seo":{"title":"Ladakh Travel Guide 2026 — Places, Hotels, How to Reach | ExploreDesh","description":"Moonscapes, Buddhist monasteries, Pangong Lake and the world's highest motorable roads. Plan your Ladakh trip: 15 places to visit, 10 stays from ₹400/night, best time (Jun – Sep) and routes.","canonical":"destination.html?slug=ladakh","ogImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1652204598207-ce07f6dd5224?crop=entropy&cs=srgb&fm=jpg&ixid=M3wxMDMzNjUxfDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8TGFkYWtoJTIwSGltYWxheWFzJTIwbW91bnRhaW58ZW58MHx8fHwxNzg3NzU2MDA4fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85","keywords":["Ladakh travel guide","places to visit in Ladakh","Ladakh hotels","best time to visit Ladakh","how to reach Ladakh","Ladakh tourism"]}}